title: "Does the code graph find the bug? Fault localisation with the Gemma 4 competition graphs"
abstract: "A model-free benchmark of how often the Gemma 4 Developer Agent competition's code graph and embeddings point at the code a fix edits, compared with grep and BM25, plus an audit of the released data."
